{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535954-w20-how-could-the-last-apis-become-minotaur","id":1535954,"title":"(W20) How could the last Apis become Minotaur?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-19T18:32:18-07:00","id":1535954,"title":"(W20) How could the last Apis become Minotaur?","content":"So I am considering introducing a plot element where, just like an early Garou rose up and became Fenris, the last Apis became Minotaur. The problem is, how could he work his way up to becoming an Incarna? Also, rehabilitating Minotaur and even making him a sept totem might come up in my games, so how can I turn Minotaur into a more positive Incarna that seeks to promote harmony among Gaia\u2019s surviving children? He is currently a totem of hate and brutality. Can he be cleanse of that and still retain his Incarna status?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T19:13:21-07:00","id":1535961,"title":"","content":"My first question would be, which place does the Skin Dancers have on your game.<br /> <br /> Revised made their relationship with Minotaur somewhat positive, at least by making them have some, and having some Skin Dancers trying to be Gaian, if not in name, then in deed.<br /> <br /> I think a lot depends now on how this link will evolve.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T20:15:18-07:00","id":1535965,"title":"","content":"There are multiple &quot;minotaurs&quot; in the World of Darkness. The last Apis is merely one of the candidates. How an ST wants to reconcile all the contradictory lore to establish a coherent story is an exercise in one's personal taste. In any case, to go from there to an Incarna, you're going to have to throw away the actual Greek myth because getting killed by Theseus would end any possible quest that might lead to his apotheosis.<br /> <br /> Personally, I would not connect the Minotaur of the Skin Dancers to any actual &quot;minotaur&quot; figure. That always seemed more like a placeholder name to me. The importance of the totem was &quot;the man that becomes the beast&quot;. Which does have an obvious connection to the minotaur legend, but also has lots of connections to other things. There is no obvious route IMO to go from &quot;the man that becomes beast&quot; to &quot;promote harmony&quot;. <br /> <br /> If you wanted to cleanse the Minotaur spirit so it is not corrupt, I think you have to find something Gaian that is inherent in the spirit's concept, and not just through some random thing into it like &quot;promote harmony&quot;. Gaian does not mean good. Nature does not care about humanity or human morality. There can be a positive spin in a spirit that recognizes the animal side of human beings, but you'll need to develop that and figure out what works best for your chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T03:18:11-07:00","id":1535979,"title":"","content":"Wasn't the minotaur a Wight?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-23T18:00:16-07:00","id":1536176,"title":"","content":"Sorry that I am late. I have been sick and work is crazy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535954-w20-how-could-the-last-apis-become-minotaur?p=1535961#post1535961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My first question would be, which place does the Skin Dancers have on your game.<br /> <br /> Revised made their relationship with Minotaur somewhat positive, at least by making them have some, and having some Skin Dancers trying to be Gaian, if not in name, then in deed.<br /> <br /> I think a lot depends now on how this link will evolve.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would like to think most of the Skin Dancers would be dead by this point. I don't use them much, and play them off as a handful of serial killers (in the eyes of the Garou) who didn't gain THAT much traction, and the Garou, who have far more experience, and more Gifts, would send out a few elite strike teams to track them down and kill ALMOST all of them off. I would have a handful be in the background, acting like an imp perched on Minotaut's shoulder. Can the Garou bring the spirit of the Last Apis to reason and service to Gaia, despite the selfish urging's of his &quot;children?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535954-w20-how-could-the-last-apis-become-minotaur?p=1535979#post1535979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't the minotaur a Wight?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not in my game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-23T18:08:25-07:00","id":1536177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535954-w20-how-could-the-last-apis-become-minotaur?p=1535965#post1535965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are multiple &quot;minotaurs&quot; in the World of Darkness. The last Apis is merely one of the candidates. How an ST wants to reconcile all the contradictory lore to establish a coherent story is an exercise in one's personal taste. In any case, to go from there to an Incarna, you're going to have to throw away the actual Greek myth because getting killed by Theseus would end any possible quest that might lead to his apotheosis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't Great Fenris die?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535954-w20-how-could-the-last-apis-become-minotaur?p=1535965#post1535965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you wanted to cleanse the Minotaur spirit so it is not corrupt, I think you have to find something Gaian that is inherent in the spirit's concept, and not just through some random thing into it like &quot;promote harmony&quot;. Gaian does not mean good. Nature does not care about humanity or human morality. There can be a positive spin in a spirit that recognizes the animal side of human beings, but you'll need to develop that and figure out what works best for your chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a REALLY great idea. Thanks! <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}